  "method": "The 17 Oct 2026 method, unchanged: startup.py (10 trials per target, process start to first 200 from GET /v1/customers?limit=1, polled every 2 ms) and latency.sh run three times (bench: one keep-alive connection, sequential, 500 warmup + 5,000 measured GET /v1/customers/{id} then the same for POST /v1/customers, Stripe-Version 2026-06-24.dahlia). Only the target list changed: the Rystic targets are pinned to v0.0.18 and v0.0.17 (rystic run -version X) and the bare builds are built at each release commit. home-turf/ holds the startup.py, latency.sh and bench.go used.",
